{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00997","headline":"横吹曲辞 关山月 · 鲍氏君[徽]微","name":"横吹曲辞 关山月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高高秋月明，北照辽阳城。\n塞迥光初满，风多晕更生。\n征人望乡思，战马闻鞞惊。\n朔风悲边草，胡沙昏虏营。\n霜疑匣中劒，风惫原上旌。\n早晚谒金阙，不闻刁斗声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍氏君[徽]微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}